#: inc/admin/settings/typography.php:242
msgid ""
"Here you can change the typography settings for individual site elements "
"regardless of basic settings. For example, change the font size for the "
"price, set the color for mobile menu links, increase post titles font size, "
"change breadcrumbs color, etc. Using “Custom selector” option allows you to "
"write your own CSS selector and apply any font rules to it."
msgstr ""
"在此处，您可以针对网站的各个元素单独调整排版设置，不受基本设置的限制。 "
"例如，更改价格的字体大小、设置移动端菜单链接的颜色、增大文章标题的字体大小、更改面包屑导航的颜色等。使用“自定义选择器”选项，您可以编写自己的 CSS "
"选择器，并为其应用任何字体规则。"

#: inc/modules/header-builder/class-backend.php:108
msgid ""
"Here you can manage your header layouts, create new ones, import and export. "
"You can set which header to use for all pages by default."
msgstr "在此处，您可以管理页眉布局、创建新布局，以及进行导入和导出操作。您可以设置默认情况下所有页面使用的页眉。"

#: inc/admin/modules/guide-tour/configs.php:185
msgid ""
"Here you’ll find options for primary color, secondary color, and links color "
"— these are key elements that define your website’s visual identity."
msgstr "在这里，您可以设置主色、辅色和链接颜色——这些是定义网站视觉形象的关键要素。"

