"If checked, the user will not be able to post a review without selecting a "
"criterion."
msgstr "如果勾选此选项，用户在未选择评分标准的情况下将无法发布评论。"

#: inc/admin/settings/maintenance.php:19
msgid ""
"If enabled you need to create maintenance page in Dashboard - Pages - Add "
"new. Choose \"Template\" to be \"Maintenance\" in \"Page attributes\". Or "
"you can import the page from our demo in \"Prebuilt websites\" page"
msgstr ""
"如果启用了此功能，您需要在“仪表盘”→“页面”→“添加新页面”中创建维护页面。在“页面属性”中，将“模板”设置为“维护”。或者，您也可以在“预建网站”页面中从我们的演示站点导入该页面。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/free-gifts/class-admin.php:225
msgid ""
"If enabled, free gifts will not be added if there is at least one product in "
"the cart that matches any exclude rule — even if some products match include "
"rules."
msgstr "如果启用此功能，当购物车中至少有一件商品符合任何排除规则时，将不会添加赠品——即使有些商品符合包含规则。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/free-gifts/class-main.php:90
msgid ""
"If enabled, the user can add the same product to the cart multiple times. It "
"works if the \"Manual Gifts\" rule is selected for the gift."
msgstr "如果启用此功能，用户可以将同一件商品多次添加到购物车中。只有当为该礼品选择了“手动礼品”规则时，此功能才有效。"

#: inc/admin/settings/wishlist.php:125
