"If the category you visit doesn't contain any subcategories, the page title "
"menu will display this category's neighbors categories."
msgstr "如果您访问的分类下没有子分类，页面标题菜单将显示该分类的相邻分类。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/estimate-delivery/class-admin.php:324
msgid ""
"If this field is filled, a hint with the specified text will appear next to "
"the notice of the current rule."
msgstr "如果填写了此字段，则当前规则的提示信息旁边会显示包含指定文本的提示。"

#: inc/admin/settings/product.php:1875
msgid ""
"If use \"Sidebar\" be sure that you have enabled it for the product page "
"layout"
msgstr "如果使用“侧边栏”，请确保已在产品页面布局中启用了该功能"

#: inc/admin/settings/general.php:1085
msgid ""
"If you apply any changes to your banner settings or content you might want "
"to force the banner to all visitors who already closed it again. In this "
"case, you just need to increase the banner version."
msgstr "如果您对横幅设置或内容进行了任何更改，可能需要将横幅强制显示给所有已关闭过该横幅的访客。在这种情况下，您只需增加横幅版本号即可。"

#: inc/admin/settings/general.php:712
msgid ""
"If you apply any changes to your popup settings or content you might want to "
"force the popup to all visitors who already closed it again. In this case, "
"you just need to increase the banner version."
msgstr "如果您对弹窗设置或内容进行了任何更改，可能需要强制向所有已关闭该弹窗的访客再次显示该弹窗。在这种情况下，您只需增加横幅版本号即可。"

#: inc/admin/settings/performance.php:52
msgid ""
"If you are not using default Gutenberg blocks you will not need these files "
"to be loaded."
msgstr "如果您未使用默认的古腾堡（Gutenberg）区块，则无需加载这些文件。"

#: inc/integrations/visual-composer/maps/popup.php:42
msgid ""
"If you are using multiple popups elements, be sure that all elements have "
"unique IDs values."
msgstr "如果您使用了多个弹出窗口元素，请确保所有元素的 ID 值都是唯一的。"

#: inc/admin/metaboxes/pages.php:158
#: inc/integrations/elementor/doc-settings/pages.php:59
msgid ""
"If you are using our header builder for your header configuration you can "
"select different layout from the list for this particular page."
msgstr "如果您正在使用我们的页眉生成器来配置页眉，则可以从列表中为该特定页面选择不同的布局。"

#: inc/admin/settings/general.php:783
msgid ""
"If you change your cookie policy information you can increase their version "
"to show the popup to all visitors again."
msgstr "如果您修改了 Cookie 政策信息，可以将版本号提高，以便再次向所有访客显示该弹窗。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/abandoned-cart/class-main.php:93
msgid ""
"If you check this box, you are giving us permission to save some of your "
"details into a contact list. You may receive email messages containing "
"information of commercial or promotional nature concerning this store.\n"
"Personal Data collected: email address, first name and last name."
