#: inc/admin/settings/product-archive.php:2847
#: inc/admin/settings/product-archive.php:2866
#: inc/admin/settings/product-archive.php:2884
msgid ""
"If you enable this option the shop filters will be always opened on the shop "
"page."
msgstr "如果启用此选项，商店页面上的筛选功能将始终处于打开状态。"

#: inc/admin/settings/other.php:166
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, a new post type for sliders will be added to your "
"Dashboard menu. You will be able to create sliders with page builder and "
"place them on any page on your website."
msgstr "如果启用此选项，仪表盘菜单中将新增一个用于幻灯片的新文章类型。您可以使用页面构建器创建幻灯片，并将其放置在网站的任意页面上。"

#: inc/admin/settings/shop.php:1018
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, the tab with the brand information will be called "
"\"About [Brand name]\"."
msgstr "如果启用此选项，显示品牌信息的标签页将命名为“关于 [品牌名称]”。"

#: inc/admin/settings/product.php:53
msgid ""
"If you have a lot of widgets added to the sidebar your single product page "
"layout may look inconsistent. Try to enable this option in this situation."
msgstr "如果侧边栏中添加了大量小工具，您的单个商品页面布局可能会显得不协调。遇到这种情况时，请尝试启用此选项。"

#: inc/admin/settings/shop.php:564
msgid ""
"If you have problems with import/export of the additional variations images "
"data, you need to use \"Variations products meta\" method."
msgstr "如果您在导入/导出附加变体图片数据时遇到问题，则需要使用“变体产品元数据”方法。"

#: inc/admin/modules/setup-wizard/templates/child-theme.php:36
msgid ""
"If you plan to make changes to the theme’s source code, we recommend using a "
"child theme instead of modifying the main theme’s HTML, CSS, or PHP files "
"directly. This way, you can safely update the parent theme without losing "
"your customizations. Use the button below to create and activate a child "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"如果您计划修改主题的源代码，我们建议使用子主题，而不是直接修改主主题的 HTML、CSS 或 PHP "
"文件。这样，您就可以在安全地更新父主题的同时，保留您的自定义设置。请点击下方的按钮来创建并激活子主题。"

#: inc/integrations/visual-composer/maps/product-filters.php:499
msgid ""
"If you select “AND”, you will be allowed to select only one attribute. In "
"case of “OR”, you will be able to select multiple values."
msgstr "如果您选择“AND”，则只能选择一个属性。如果是“OR”，则可以选择多个值。"

#: inc/admin/settings/blog.php:616
msgid ""
"If you set this option to \"Excerpt\" then you would be able to set a custom "
"excerpt for each post or it will be cut from the post content. If you choose "
"\"Full content\" then all content will be shown, or you can add the \"Read "
"more button\" while editing the post and by doing this cut your excerpt "
"length as you need."
msgstr ""
"如果您将此选项设置为“摘要”，则可以为每篇帖子设置自定义摘要，否则系统将从帖子内容中自动截取摘要。 "
"如果您选择“完整内容”，则将显示全部内容；或者，您可以在编辑文章时添加“阅读更多”按钮，通过这种方式根据需要控制摘要的长度。"

#: inc/admin/settings/product.php:261
msgid ""
"If you turn on this option, the section with description will be sticky when "
"you scroll the page. In case when the description is higher than images, the "
"images section will be fixed instead."
msgstr "如果启用此选项，当您滚动页面时，包含描述的区域将保持固定。如果描述位于图片上方，则图片区域将保持固定。"

#: inc/admin/settings/shop.php:1399
msgid ""
"If you use custom extra content you can disable default WooCommerce order "
"details on the thank you page"
msgstr "如果您使用了自定义的额外内容，可以在“感谢”页面上禁用 WooCommerce 的默认订单详情"

#: inc/admin/settings/product-archive.php:1133
#: inc/integrations/elementor/elements/class-product-filters.php:263
#: inc/integrations/elementor/elements/class-product-categories.php:199
#: inc/integrations/visual-composer/maps/product-filters.php:390
#: inc/integrations/visual-composer/maps/categories.php:189
msgid ""
"If you visit category Man, for example, only man's subcategories will be "
"shown in the page title like T-shirts, Coats, Shoes etc."
msgstr "例如，如果您访问“男装”分类，页面标题中只会显示男装的子分类，如T恤、外套、鞋子等。"

#: inc/admin/settings/shop.php:935
msgid ""
"If you want to show brand image on your product page select desired "
"attribute here. Read more information in our <a href=\"https://xtemos."
"com/docs-topic/product-brands/\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"如果您想在产品页面上展示品牌形象，请在此处选择所需的属性。更多信息请参阅我们的<a href=\"https://xtemos.com/docs-"
"topic/product-brands/\" target=\"_blank\">文档</a>。"

