#: inc/admin/settings/typography.php:201
msgid ""
"Note that if you use Google fonts, only select font weights will be loaded "
"on your website. So if you set font-weight 400 for body and 600 for headings,"
" you will not be able to set 100, 300, or 700 font-weight for some of the "
"Elementor/WPBakery elements. If you want to load additional font weights but "
"don't want to set them globally, go to Advanced Typography, add a new rule "
"with your font-family and font-weight without assigning it to any of the "
"elements. Then, you will have this font-weight loaded globally so you can "
"set it for any of the WPBakery/Elementor elements."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果您使用 Google 字体，网站上只会加载部分字重。 因此，如果您将正文的字重设置为 400，标题的字重设置为 600，则无法为某些 "
"Elementor/WPBakery 组件设置 100、300 或 700 的字重。 "
"如果您希望加载额外的字重，但又不希望全局设置，请前往“高级排版”设置，添加一条包含您的字体家族和字重的全新规则，且不要将其分配给任何元素。这样，该字重就会被全局加载，您便可将其应用于任何"
" WPBakery/Elementor 元素。"

