#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/price-tracker/emails/class-xts-email-price-tracker-subscribe.php:52
msgid ""
"This email confirms that the customer has successfully subscribed to price "
"drop alerts for this product."
msgstr "本邮件确认该客户已成功订阅了该产品的降价提醒。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/waitlist/class-frontend.php:292
msgid "This email is already registered in the waitlist for this product."
msgstr "该邮箱已注册到该产品的候补名单中。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/review-reminder/emails/class-xts-email-review-reminder.php:38
msgid ""
"This email is sent to customers as a reminder to leave a review for their "
"recent purchase."
msgstr "此电子邮件是发送给客户的，旨在提醒他们为最近的购买留下评价。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/wishlist/emails/class-back-in-stock-email.php:48
msgid ""
"This email is sent to customers when an item of their wishlist is back in "
"stock"
msgstr "当客户“心愿单”中的商品有货时，系统会向其发送这封邮件"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/wishlist/emails/class-on-sale-products-email.php:48
msgid ""
"This email is sent to customers when an item of their wishlist is on sale"
msgstr "当客户“心愿单”中的某件商品打折时，系统会向其发送这封邮件"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/price-tracker/emails/class-xts-email-price-tracker.php:59
msgid ""
"This email is sent to customers when the price drops on products they are "
"watching."
msgstr "当客户关注的商品价格下降时，系统会向其发送这封电子邮件。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/wishlist/emails/class-promotional-email.php:76
msgid ""
"This email is sent to the customer that has a product on his wishlist. You "
"can send these emails via Dashboard -> Products -> Wishlists -> Popular "
"products -> Create promotion."
msgstr "这封邮件将发送给将某款产品加入愿望清单的客户。您可以通过“仪表盘”→“产品”→“愿望清单”→“热门产品”→“创建促销活动”来发送此类邮件。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/abandoned-cart/emails/class-xts-email-abandoned-cart.php:54
msgid ""
"This email reminds customers about their incomplete purchases, encouraging "
"them to complete their orders."
msgstr "这封电子邮件旨在提醒客户其未完成的购买，并鼓励他们完成订单。"

#: inc/integrations/woocommerce/modules/linked-variations/class-main.php:34
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to create a new kind of variable product based on "
"simple products. You can create linked variations bundles via Dashboard -> "
"Products -> Linked variations. Read more information in our <a href=\"https:"
"//xtemos.com/docs-topic/linked-variations/\" target=\"_blank\">"
"documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"此功能允许您基于简易商品创建一种新型的可变商品。您可以通过“仪表盘”→“商品”→“关联变体”来创建关联变体组合。 更多信息请参阅我们的 <a "
"href=\"https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/linked-variations/\" target=\"_blank\">"
"文档</a>。"

